            "head": "The New Masculinity: Exploring Men's Makeup",
            "content": " “My three-month old doesn’t understand how great sleep is and I looked like a zombie on all my zoom meetings. With NuNorm’s concealer and anti-shine powder I feel so much better about myself and really feel like I am putting my best face forward. I plan to stick with this duo even after my kid learns to sleep. Hopefully soon!”"
