            "serial-no": "",
            "head": "Bold and Masculine: Men's Makeup Techniques",
            "content": "“I thought I was just stuck with giant pores and a red rosy nose for life. My girlfriend bought me the tinted moisturizer and anti shine powder because she was tired of me refusing to take pictures with her. I feel so much more confident now and can’t believe it took me this long to try makeup! I’m a convert.”"
          }
        }
